        "kind": "card",
        "template": "title-left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2_desk",
      "text": "This is a working studio's book. Eight thousand three hundred fifty dollars outstanding. Three invoices past due. Nine hundred already collected through PayPal. The mandate is the product: two contacts a week, never below seventy percent up front, no discount without asking, three instalments inside forty-five days.",
