      "id": "s3_negotiation",
      "text": "Acme's accounts-payable agent can release twelve hundred dollars without a human. Kindly wants sixteen eighty up front. Their counter breaks the seventy percent floor, so the policy engine refuses it automatically \u2014 no model involved \u2014 and Kindly holds. Their agent escalates to its finance lead. Both sides stop where a human should stop. Every envelope is signed and verified.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "page",
        "src": "https://kindly-desk-web.vercel.app/n/01a19ba6-1181-70b2-ace5-9f5f7ed1ef68",
